    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Make h the subject of the formula A = (1/2)bh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Think first: h is multiplied by both b and one half, so undo the fraction and the b."
    },
    {
      "type": "asset",
      "storagePath": "assets/question_visuals/p056_q12.jpg",
      "altText": "Source visual for edmar-csec-p056-q12 from workbook page 56."
